object:
  title: Product Recognition vs Commons Outcome Crosswalk
  type: option-entry
  category: impact-measurement
  what_it_is: Separate product-quality awards and market recognition from cooperative governance, livelihood, ecological and public-value outcomes.
  potential_uses: Claims review, communications, funder reports and implementation memory.
  dependencies: Award criteria, production data and distinct social/ecological evidence.
  tradeoffs: May undervalue symbolic recognition or over-formalize community achievements.
